      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Cache behavior",
      "items": [
        "Resolve the requested ref before checking SQLite.",
        "A stored snapshot bypasses source downloads and parsing.",
        "On a miss, fetch supported sources, build the graph, then persist it."
      ]
